{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":981710,"name":"MoonDrinker","username":"MoonDrinker","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/eb8c5e/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-10-25T02:20:42.688Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e测试方法：\u003cbr\u003e\n在 Pi 中接入 K3.1 Pro 进行开发，结束后将 Input/Output/Cache Read 各自的 Token 统计数量与控制台详情（按分钟统计，精确至 0.01%）结合进行拟合计算\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003e扣费点数 = x·Input + y·Output + z·CacheRead，单位是点 / 1M tokens\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e下图中 K3 公式源于大佬测试（方法也进行了参考）：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e你也可以试，但我这个公式是最精准的，Kimi 消耗额度不是按 API 价格算的，而是按以下方式（199套餐）：\u003cbr\u003e\n未命中输入（全新上下文）：每 1M Token 扣除约 6.61% 周额度\u003cbr\u003e\n缓存命中读取（复用上下文）：每 1M Token 扣除约 0.0391% 周额度\u003cbr\u003e\n模型生成输出（含推理思考）：每 1M Token 扣除约 50.71% 周额度\u003cbr\u003e\n你可以拿这个公式去套，我测过很多次，误差极低…\u003cbr\u003e\n需要注意的是，因为缓存命中价格过低，控制台疑似会将 \u0026lt;0.01% 的用量显示为 0.01%，因此缓存命中只测量得到较为准确的上限，仍需更多数据修订\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e将 Allegretto 周限额 1% 记作单位一，接下来的计算都基于进度条百分比\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://oss.locdd.com/2026/10/25/1792894840302.png\" alt=\"image\" width=\"690\" height=\"244\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https://oss.locdd.com/2026/10/25/1792894840922.png\" alt=\"image\" width=\"690\" height=\"242\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n可能因为订阅价格本身就接近算力成本，所以 K3.1 Pro 在订阅中相较于 K3 的价格下降比例并没有 API 中那么大\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e下图最后一列是按照\"降价比例与 API 相同\"估算的消耗（仅供参考对比即可）\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://oss.locdd.com/2026/10/25/1792894841508.png\" alt=\"image\" width=\"690\" height=\"159\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n对于 Allegretto 而言，按月订阅是 199CNY，这里按照 200CNY 进行计算；按年订阅是 159CNY，这里按照 160CNY 进行计算\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e据此订阅折算 API 价格如下（单位 CNY/MToken）：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://oss.locdd.com/2026/10/25/1792894841680.png\" alt=\"image\" width=\"690\" height=\"148\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":19,"updated_at":"2026-10-25T02:20:42.688Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":1,"readers_count":0,"score":10.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":103607,"topic_slug":"topic","display_username":"MoonDrinker","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":29,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/topic/103607/1","locale":null,"is_localized":false,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":982156,"name":"DreamRiver","username":"DreamRiver","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/dfb087/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-10-25T04:28:10.343Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e之前只是听说降价了，具体降了多少也没个实测。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e感谢大佬提供实测，85%的话，感觉降价幅度不大，仍然会有和k3一个问题，偏贵无人用。\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":19,"updated_at":"2026-10-25T04:28:10.343Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":1,"readers_count":0,"score":0.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":103607,"topic_slug":"topic","display_username":"DreamRiver","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":31,"hidden