sername":"SunnyDoll","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e274bd/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-10-25T12:37:15.296Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e大佬，我看了一下你的帖子，你说昨晚改动后的数据和我测试的差不多（不过缓存读取不太一样\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e换算方法\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n按照 \u003ccode\u003e月额度 = 5 × 周额度，周额度 = 5 × 5h 额度\u003c/code\u003e，把周额度的 1% 记作 1 点，那么 5h 额度就是 20 点\u003cbr\u003e\n用 20 点除以 5H 用量（M Token），就能得到每 1M token 扣多少点：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e项目（点/MTok）\u003cbr\u003e\n改动前\u003cbr\u003e\n改动后\u003cbr\u003e\n本贴\u003cbr\u003e\nK3（参考）\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e输入\u003cbr\u003e\n8.73\u003cbr\u003e\n5.56\u003cbr\u003e\n5.5～5.9\u003cbr\u003e\n6.61\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e输出\u003cbr\u003e\n69.0\u003cbr\u003e\n44.4\u003cbr\u003e\n44.3～45.6\u003cbr\u003e\n50.71\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e缓存读取\u003cbr\u003e\n0.087\u003cbr\u003e\n0.111\u003cbr\u003e\n≤0.037\u003cbr\u003e\n0.0391\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e感觉缓存命中确实不太好测，最小二乘对缓存系数几乎没有约束，误差可能比较大（（\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e这样说的话，额度确实提升了一点点（（\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":17,"post_type":1,"posts_count":19,"updated_at":"2026-10-25T12:37:15.296Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":103607,"topic_slug":"topic","display_username":"SunnyDoll","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":44,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/topic/103607/17","locale":null,"is_localized":false,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":983165,"name":"WindTraveler","username":"WindTraveler","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/a9a28c/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-10-25T12:37:19.529Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e我感觉kimi这两天的额度变多了，是不是我的错觉\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":18,"post_type":1,"posts_count":19,"updated_at":"2026-10-25T12:37:19.529Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":103607,"topic_slug":"topic","display_username":"WindTraveler","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":30,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/topic/103607/18","locale":null,"is_localized":false,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":983166,"name":"RainPoet","username":"RainPoet","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/8baadc/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-10-25T12:37:23.721Z","cooked":"\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e订阅老版 Kimi 会员计划的 Allegro（699 元/月）套餐已有数月，日常高强度用下来一直对套餐内部的实际扣费规则比较好奇，恰逢近期 K3.1 系列上线，索性做了一轮定量实测，把 Code 额度下 6 个模型的计费方程、之前大家讨论好久的 K3 256K 阈值规则、折算官方 API 的回本价值以及各模型吞吐算了一遍，分享给大佬们一同探讨。需要说明的是，该套餐实际还包含月度总额度，但受限于无…\u003cbr\u003e\n参考上面这位大佬的方法进行了校准，结果如下：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAllegretto（¥199），K3.1 Pro\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e计费项\u003cbr\u003e\n5h 权重 (M⁻¹)\u003cbr\u003e\n7d 权重 (M⁻¹)\u003cbr\u003e\n相对 Allegro\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e输入\u003cbr\u003e\n0.2810 [0.2808, 0.2811]\u003cbr\u003e\n0.0562\u003cbr\u003e\n3.00×\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e读缓\u003cbr\u003e\n0.001407 [0.001372, 0.001425]\u003cbr\u003e\n0.000281\u003cbr\u003e\n2.98×\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e输出\u003cbr\u003e\n2.247 [2.243, 2.261]\u003cbr\u003e\n0.449\u003cbr\u003e\n2.99×\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e权重 = 每 1M token 消耗该窗口额度的比例（×100 即百分比）\u003cbr\u003e\n例如 5h 输入权重 0.2810 表示：每输出 1M token 消耗 28.1% 的 5h 额度\u003cbr\u003e\n方括号内为严格可行区间。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e比例 \u003ccode\u003e1 : 1/200 : 8.0\u003c/code\u003e，与 Allegro 完全一致，\u003ccode\u003eAllegro ≈ Allegretto * 3\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e7d = 5 × 5h，月 = 5 × 7d\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e控制台明细单位是月额度百分比，按 \u003ccode\u003emax(0.01, 四舍五入)\u003c/code\u003e 显示，所以小请求会被高估\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e","post_number":19,"post_type":1,"posts_count":19,"updated_at":"2026-10-25T12:37:23.721Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":103607,"topic_slug":"topic","display_username":"RainPoet","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":45,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/topic/103607/19","locale":null,"is_localized":false,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_